{"id":"vod_sn_36212","vodId":"36212","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"女皇之刃 流浪的战士","name_cn":"女皇之刃 流浪的战士","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/cbed6c1a3fe9f7e099c8ea3725c7eb9a.jpg"},"summary":"《女皇之刃流浪的战士》由日本视觉战斗书系列《女皇之刃》中的基本设计为基础发展而成的动画系列第一季。作品的特色是集数位性感美少女斗士们的大胆格斗动作。动画版「女皇之刃流浪的战士」的故事构成也是以超强意识的「战斗魅力」，活用原作的世界观表现了美少女斗士们的魅力。故事中，正派美女、罗丽塔、小恶魔系、外冷内热、可爱性感美眉、妖娆姐姐等各具魅力的角色将一一登场。动画制作交由出品过「MEZZO」「一骑当千GreatGuardians」等作的ARM-S，监督是曾负责过「梦幻模拟战III」的动画映像和TV动画「现视研2」的よしもときんじ，人设原案集众多顶级插画师于一身。CAST方面更是强大得让人泪流满面呢，川澄凌子、能登麻美子、平野绫、田中敦子等人气声优的参演令人期待度满载！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RSUANSnczN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n1w4dMzH5V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pkyET1grp21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fTv4dcBy1V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ae3NP8pvR51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6aTwnH6imL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qxgMLpPxxi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dX9rfrd1r11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LusWPUy4W21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vgQvrMM07D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8qsbprraMn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zkXevwpmBC1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:25.612Z"}